   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/02.webp",
   "text": "Bathtime is Jack's favourite part of the day. 'I'll be back in a few moments,' says his mom."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/03.webp",
   "text": "'Make sure to clean behind your ears.'"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/04.webp",
   "text": "There's a SWOOSH. And a swish of a tail."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/05.webp",
   "text": "And then..."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/06.webp",
   "text": "Jack's bathtub safari begins!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/07.webp",
   "text": "Look at what's coming!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/08.webp",
   "text": "There's a twist and a turn... Something's growing... It's a..."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/09.webp",
   "text": "Tooot!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/10.webp",
   "text": "There's a RUMBLE! It's going up UP UP..."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/11.webp",
   "text": "And..."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/12.webp",
   "text": "SPLASH!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/13.webp",
   "text": "There's a SPLOSH. Something bubbles.\n\nIt's time to..."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/14.webp",
   "text": "AAAAAAH..... But something's lurking in the background...."
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/15.webp",
   "text": "ROAR!"
  },
  {
   "img": "img/asp-bathtub-safari/16.webp",
   "text": "'Time to get out. I hope you're clean and ready for bed.'"
